  "notes": [
    "The three pinned cores expose the same call topology for both Category Colors update_option(name, value, true) and Tribe__Cache::set_last_occurrence update_option(name, value) paths.",
    "wp_default_autoload_value and wp_max_autoloaded_option_size are unreachable for Category Colors explicit autoload=true but reachable for absent or computed-autoload tribe_last_save_post rows.",
    "The stock cache.php and class-wp-object-cache.php bytes are identical across all three pins and expose no callback hook around wp_cache_get/set/delete; external object-cache drop-ins are refused before invocation.",
    "The exact TEC 6.17.2 and 6.17.3 Category Colors, cache/listener/container, option-hook singleton, configuration, event/occurrence/builder, and occurrence-generator bytes are identical across the reviewed derived-state paths."
  ]
